---
import ResourceList from "@/components/common/ResourceList.astro";
import {
  aiSystemsPathSteps,
  aiSystemsResourceIds,
  aiSystemsTermNotes,
} from "@/data/ai-systems-path";
import { t } from "@/lib/i18n";
import type { Locale } from "@/types/content";

interface Props {
  locale: Locale;
}

const { locale } = Astro.props;
const bn = locale === "bn";
---

<section class="section section--tinted ai-systems-path" id="ai-systems-path">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="section-head">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">
          {
            bn
              ? "Buzzword নয়—আগে কাজের ক্ষমতা"
              : "Capabilities before buzzwords"
          }
        </p>
        <h2>
          {
            bn
              ? "একটি prompt থেকে নির্ভরযোগ্য agentic system"
              : "From one prompt to a dependable agentic system"
          }
        </h2>
      </div>
      <p class="lede">
        {
          bn
            ? "সব term একই স্তরের নয়। আগে মাপা যায় এমন সমস্যা আর baseline, তারপর context ও workflow; সত্যিই অনিশ্চয়তা থাকলে তবেই agent যোগ করো।"
            : "These terms do not belong at the same level. Begin with a measurable problem and baseline, add context and workflow, then introduce agency only when real ambiguity requires it."
        }
      </p>
    </header>

    <ol class="systems-steps" role="list">
      {
        aiSystemsPathSteps.map((step) => (
          <li id={`ai-system-${step.id}`}>
            <article>
              <h3>{t(step.title, locale)}</h3>
              <p>{t(step.intent, locale)}</p>
              <p class="build-note">
                <strong>
                  {bn ? "যে evidence বানাবে:" : "Build evidence:"}
                </strong>{" "}
                {t(step.build, locale)}
              </p>
              <ul
                class="term-chips"
                aria-label={bn ? "মূল ধারণা" : "Key terms"}
              >
                {step.terms.map((term) => (
                  <li>{term}</li>
                ))}
              </ul>
            </article>
          </li>
        ))
      }
    </ol>

    <div class="systems-lower">
      <section aria-labelledby="term-map-title">
        <p class="eyebrow">{bn ? "শব্দগুলোর মানচিত্র" : "Term map"}</p>
        <h2 id="term-map-title">
          {
            bn
              ? "কোন tool কোথায় কাজে লাগে—আর কোথায় লাগে না"
              : "Where the tools fit—and where they do not"
          }
        </h2>
        <div class="term-map">
          {
            aiSystemsTermNotes.map((note) => (
              <article>
                <h3>{note.term}</h3>
                <p>{t(note.meaning, locale)}</p>
                <p class="placement">
                  <strong>{bn ? "কখন:" : "When:"}</strong>{" "}
                  {t(note.placement, locale)}
                </p>
              </article>
            ))
          }
        </div>
      </section>

      <aside class="resource-shelf" aria-labelledby="systems-resources-title">
        <p class="eyebrow">
          {bn ? "শুরু করার মূল জায়গা" : "Primary starting points"}
        </p>
        <h2 id="systems-resources-title">
          {
            bn
              ? "আগে ধারণা বোঝো, তারপর একটি stack বেছে নাও"
              : "Learn the concepts, then choose one stack"
          }
        </h2>
        <p>
          {
            bn
              ? "একসঙ্গে সব framework বা provider জমিয়ো না। Official guide দেখে agent, RAG, workflow আর runtime-এর সীমা মিলিয়ে বোঝো।"
              : "Do not collect every framework or provider. Use official guides to compare the boundaries of agents, RAG, workflows and runtimes."
          }
        </p>
        <ResourceList
          locale={locale}
          resourceIds={[...aiSystemsResourceIds]}
          compact
        />
      </aside>
    </div>

    <aside
      class="start-small"
      aria-labelledby="start-small-title"
      data-ui="compact-action-panel"
    >
      <div>
        <p class="callout__label">{bn ? "প্রথম project" : "First project"}</p>
        <h2 id="start-small-title">
          {
            bn
              ? "Inbox সামলানো agent নয়—আগে বানাও read-only document helper।"
              : "Not an inbox agent—a read-only document helper."
          }
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="start-small__action">
        <p>
          {
            bn
              ? "নিজের ক্ষতিহীন পাঁচটি document নাও, আটটি labelled question বানাও, রাখো একটি keyword baseline। উত্তরের সঙ্গে source দেখাবে, evidence না থাকলে ‘জানি না’ বলবে। এটুকু ঠিক হলে একটি ছোট read-only tool আর সীমাবদ্ধ loop যোগ করতে পারো।"
              : "Use five harmless documents you own, eight labelled questions, a keyword baseline, sourced answers and refusal when evidence is absent. Only then add one narrow read-only tool and a bounded loop."
          }
        </p>
        <a class="button" href="#stage-foundation">
          {
            bn
              ? "বিস্তারিত রোডম্যাপে এগোও"
              : "Continue into the detailed roadmap"
          }
        </a>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .systems-steps {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin: 2rem 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    counter-reset: systems-path;
  }
  .systems-steps > li {
    min-width: 0;
    counter-increment: systems-path;
  }
  .systems-steps article,
  .term-map article {
    height: 100%;
    padding: 1.2rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    background: var(--color-surface-raised);
  }
  .systems-steps h3,
  .term-map h3 {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .systems-steps p,
  .term-map p {
    margin: 0.65rem 0 0;
  }
  .build-note,
  .placement {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
  .term-chips {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    margin: 1rem 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }
  .term-chips li {
    padding: 0.28rem 0.55rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border-strong);
    border-radius: 999px;
    color: var(--color-primary-strong);
    font-weight: 750;
    font-size: 0.73rem;
  }
  .systems-lower {
    display: grid;
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-top: 3rem;
  }
  .term-map {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
  }
  .resource-shelf {
    align-self: start;
    padding: 1.3rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    background: var(--color-surface);
  }
  .resource-shelf > h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 2.5vw, 1.8rem);
  }
  .start-small {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.25rem 2.5rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    padding: clamp(1.35rem, 3vw, 2rem);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-inline-start: 0.35rem solid var(--color-teal);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    background: var(--color-code);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
  }
  .start-small h2 {
    max-width: 26ch;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(1.45rem, 3vw, 2.15rem);
    line-height: 1.18;
  }
  .start-small__action {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.15rem;
    align-content: center;
  }
  .start-small__action p {
    max-width: 62ch;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }
  .start-small__action .button {
    justify-self: start;
  }
  @media (min-width: 48rem) {
    .systems-steps,
    .term-map {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }
  @media (min-width: 68rem) {
    .systems-steps {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
    .resource-shelf :global(.resource-list) {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 0 1.5rem;
    }
    .start-small {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(19rem, 0.85fr) minmax(24rem, 1.15fr);
      align-items: center;
    }
  }
</style>
